2026-09-25 — Claude (claude-opus-5-5), working for Nathan (nkessel)
Branch: claude/forms-org-import-fab → PR into development_branch

What / why
- Created development_branch from main (it didn't exist yet; guideline 10 says we work there). No content changes on it; everything else goes through this PR (guideline 9).
- git pull + checked open PRs first (none) (guideline 8).
- Org data: added scripts/import-orgs.mjs and ran it against aissatabarry/ma-climate-coalition-map
  (commit e8bb5ce, 2026-09-25) because Nathan said that repo is the most up-to-date org source.
  -> 150 orgs, 88 logos (public/logos/*.png, extracted from embedded base64), 175 memberships.
  -> Coalitions now match the source's 8: MPF, MYCC, EJLT, GJC, CRS, HERO kept their projects/events/actions;
     CCCC and SCJC added (no projects/events yet).
  -> Dropped mara, gfn, ghs, zcrf (not in the source) with their 12 projects, 12 events, 12 actions,
     per "get rid of any projects or events that belong to orgs not on this list". Projects/events are
     attached to coalitions in our schema, so "belongs to" was read as "belongs to a coalition not on the list".
  -> Source has no member ties for CCCC, CRS, HERO, so they show 0 members.
  -> Source has no town/description for orgs, and type only for school clubs; the rest are "unknown"
     until groups fill them in via the org form.
- Forms + sheet: apps-script/Code.gs builds 4 Google Forms (org, event, project, feedback) linked to a sheet,
  seeds the sheet from development_branch's data.json, applies submissions (blank = keep), logs changes,
  and serves public data as JSON. All questions optional except "which one is this about?" (and the feedback
  message), per Nathan's request. Includes every question from the team's existing "Climate Map Modification
  Form" (organization, contact info, event name/description, date/time/location, climate topic tags).
  Tested with a mocked Sheets/Forms runtime in Node (seed → data.json round-trip, and simulated submissions).
  Not yet run inside real Google Apps Script — first real run may surface permission/API quirks.
- App: + floating action button (src/fab.ts) with the 4 forms, pre-filled with the org/coalition open in the
  drawer; org drawer shows logo, abbreviation, profile scores, and an "Update this organization's info" link.
  Form URLs go in src/forms.config.ts after setup (empty until then; menu says "Form not connected yet").
- Added LLM_GUIDELINES.md (featured in README) and CLAUDE.md so Claude Code sessions pick the rules up.

